# Check out text files with LF on every platform.
#
# oxfmt (via ultracite) formats with LF and `oxfmt --check` treats CRLF as a
# format issue. GitHub's windows-latest runners default to core.autocrlf=true,
# so without this every file arrived CRLF and `bun run check` failed on the
# whole repository regardless of what a change touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep generated lockfiles diffable but never line-ending-converted.
bun.lock -text
Cargo.lock text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
